  "confidence": "high",
  "decision_summary": "The query is letrozole, a 1,2,4-triazole with two p-cyanophenyl groups. All retrieved experimental evidence from structurally related triazole drugs (vorozole, MMV367, doravirine, orteronel, vonoprazan) shows oral bioavailability values of 36-90%, all above the 20% threshold. No evidence indicates low bioavailability. Therefore, predict high.",
